    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9433" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντανά-κλᾰσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reflection of light,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Placit.
				4.14.3
			</span></i>, cf. Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				1.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				9.12.1
			</span></i> (pl.); also, of sound, <i>echo,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.502d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bending back,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκίστρου</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.216
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>use of a word in an altered sense,</i> Lat. <i>contraria
				significatio,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Quint.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				9.3.68
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.746
			</span></i>.</div>
